ice","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head","quote":"王敦，字處仲，司徒導之從父兄也。父基，治書侍御史。敦少有奇人之目，尚武帝女襄城公主，拜駙馬都尉，除太子舍人。時王愷、石崇以豪侈相尚，愷嘗置酒，敦與導俱在坐，有女伎吹笛小失聲韻，愷便驅殺之，一坐改容，敦神色自若。他日，又造愷，愷使美人行酒，以客飲不盡，輒殺之。酒至敦、導所，敦故不肯持，美人悲懼失色，而敦傲然不視。導素不能飲，恐行酒者得罪，遂勉強盡觴。導還，歎曰：「處仲若當世，心懷剛忍，非令終也。」洗馬潘滔見敦而目之曰：「處仲蜂目已露，但豺聲未振，若不噬人，亦當為人所噬。」及太子遷許昌，詔東宮官屬不得送。敦及洗馬江統、潘滔，舍人杜蕤、魯瑤等，冒禁于路側望拜流涕，時論稱之。遷給事黃門侍郎。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head:m0257"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w043-dun-early-4:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head","start":255,"end":257,"surface":"洗馬","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:head:m0257","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-liangshu-043-jiangziyi-1-14","title":"散騎常侍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w","attestations":[{"id":"th-liangshu-043-jiangziyi-1-14:a","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"散騎常侍","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001:m0018","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-043","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi","source_id":"s-liangshu-043-jiangziyi-ws2087360","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001","quote":"江子一字元貞，濟陽考城人，晉散騎常侍統之七世孫也。父法成，天監中奉朝請。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangziyi:p001:m0018"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Code